            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "運動巨頭風光不再？Nike遭標普100剔除後 道瓊地位也告急",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e90f4e9df5e801a72d94ae1db45db3d5862e459907ad08737f82d8d063652b83/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F120c8fda2409f517d526ccd1bb62299e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%95%E5%B7%A8%E9%A0%AD%E9%A2%A8%E5%85%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D-nike%E9%81%AD%E6%A8%99%E6%99%AE100%E5%89%94%E9%99%A4%E5%BE%8C-%E9%81%93%E7%93%8A%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%E4%B9%9F%E5%91%8A%E6%80%A5-160005286.html",
